sequenceDiagram
    participant API as LLM API
    participant CPP as AiBridge (C++)
    participant RPC as JaspRpcDispatcher
    participant AST as AgentStateTracker
    participant JS as chat-bridge.js
    participant DC as deep-chat

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over API,DC: TOOL CALL LOOP (full cycle)
        API-->>CPP: delta.tool_calls: [{id:"call_1", function:{name:"analysis_create"}}]
        loop Fragment accumulation
            CPP->>CPP: processToolCalls()
            Note over CPP: accumulate by call id in m_toolCallAccum<br/>record order in m_toolCallOrder<br/>null-id fragments → m_lastToolCallId fallback
            API-->>CPP: delta.tool_calls: [{id:null, function:{arguments:"..."}}]
            Note over CPP: arguments concatenated into accumulated call
        end
        API-->>CPP: data: [DONE]
        Note over CPP: onReplyFinished() → flushToolCalls()
        Note over CPP: m_processingReply = true (blocks re-entrant clearChat/startStream)
        CPP->>CPP: build assistant message from m_assistantDelta + tool_calls array
        CPP->>CPP: insert assistant msg at correct position in m_conversation
        loop For each tool call (in m_toolCallOrder arrival order)
            CPP->>CPP: security gate: effectiveToolsForActivePersona() check
            alt Tool NOT allowed by persona
                CPP->>CPP: block dispatch, return error message
            else Tool allowed
                CPP->>RPC: dispatch("analysis_create", {module:"jaspTTests", analysis:"TTestIndependent"})
                Note over RPC: validates params against OpenRPC schema
                Note over RPC: checks AgentStateTracker::isUserDiverged()
                RPC->>AST: markClean() after building _stateUpdate
                RPC-->>CPP: result JSON (with _stateUpdate if workspace changed)
            end
            CPP->>CPP: append tool result to m_conversation as {role:"tool", tool_call_id:"call_1", content:"…"}
            CPP->>CPP: add to m_pendingToolCalls
        end
        Note over CPP: m_pendingToolCalls not empty → continue loop
        alt m_deferredClearChat is set
            CPP->>CPP: abort loop — clearConversation, onClearChat, sendIntroMessage
        else Normal continuation
            CPP-->>JS: emit onStreamOpen()
            JS->>DC: signals.onOpen() (new bubble in same message group)
            CPP->>API: POST /chat/completions (with tool results in conversation)
            Note over API,CPP: Loop continues until API returns content without tool_calls
            API-->>CPP: delta: {"content":"Done! The t-test analysis has been created."}
            CPP-->>JS: onStreamChunk("Done! The t-test…")
            JS->>DC: signals.onResponse({text:"Done! The t-test…"})
            API-->>CPP: data: [DONE]
            Note over CPP: onReplyFinished → no tool calls → save assistant msg
            Note over CPP: if m_deferredClearChat → execute now
            CPP-->>JS: emit onStreamClose()
            JS->>DC: signals.onClose()
        end
    end
